        <body>
            <div xml:id="d418">

                <pb facs="0314" n="242" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg242"/>

                <head>Municipal Council of Kidderminster</head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>Kidderminster</placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1865-05-03">May 3, 1865</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>At a meeting of the town council of the borough of Kidderminster, in the county
                    of Worcester, held Wednesday, the 3d day of May, 1865.</p>
                <p>Moved by Mr. Councillor P. Talbot; seconded by Mr. Councillor Boycott—</p>
                <p>That this council, representing the inhabitants of the borough of Kidderminster,
                    desires to give utterance to the feelings of grief and horror at the
                    assassination of President Lincoln, and the attempted murder of Mr. Seward, and
                    to convey to the United States government and people, and to Mrs. Lincoln, an
                    expression of its profound sympathy and sincere condolence. Carried
                    unanimously.</p>
            </div>
